\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\qj\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Customer Shopping Behavior Analysis\par
\b0\fs22\par
\b\fs28 1. Project Overview\par
\b0\fs22\tab This project analyzes customer shopping behavior using transactional data from 3,900 purchases across various product categories. The goal is to uncover insights into spending patterns, customer segments, product preferences, and subscription behavior to guide strategic business decisions.\par
\par
\b\fs28 2. Dataset Summary\b0\fs22\par
\tab - Rows: 3,900\par
\tab - Columns: 18\par
\tab - Key Features:\par
\tab - Customer demographics (Age, Gender, Location, Subscription Status)\par
\tab - Purchase details (Item Purchased, Category, Purchase Amount, Season, Size, Color)\par
\tab - Shopping behavior (Discount Applied, Promo Code Used, Previous Purchases, \tab           \tab    Frequency of Purchases, Review Rating, Shipping Type)\par
\tab - Missing Data: 37 values in Review Rating column\par
\par
\b\fs28 3. Exploratory Data Analysis using Python\b0\fs22\par
 \tab Data preparation and cleaning in Python:\par
\tab\tab\f1\u9679?\f0  Data Loading: Imported the dataset using pandas.\par
\tab\tab\f1\u9679?\f0  Initial Exploration: Used df.info() to check structure and .describe() for \tab\tab\tab      summary statistics.\par
\tab\tab\f1\u9679?\f0  Missing Data Handling: Checked for null values and imputed missing values      \tab\tab     in the Review Rating column using the median rating of each product \tab\tab\tab     category.\par
\tab\tab\f1\u9679?\f0  Column Standardization: Renamed columns to snake case for better \tab\tab\tab       readability and documentation.\par
\tab\tab\f1\u9679?\f0  Feature Engineering:\par
\tab\tab\tab\f1\u9675?\f0  Created age_group column by binning customer ages.\par
 \tab\tab\tab\f1\u9675?\f0  Created purchase_frequency_days column from purchase data.\par
\tab\tab\f1\u9679?\f0  Data Consistency Check: Verified if discount_applied and \tab\tab\tab\tab\tab      promo_code_us were redundant; dropped promo_code_used.\par
\tab\tab\f1\u9679?\f0  Database Integration: Connected Python script to PostgreSQL and loaded \tab\tab\tab      the cleaned DataFrame into the database for SQL analysis.\par
\par
\b\fs28 4. Data Analysis using SQL (Business Transactions)\b0\fs22\par
\tab Performed structured analysis in PostgreSQL to answer key business questions:\par
\tab\tab 1. Revenue by Gender \f2\endash  Compared total revenue generated by male vs. \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 f\f0\lang1033 emale \f2\lang9 customers.\par
\tab\tab 2. High-Spending Discount Users \endash  Identified customers who used discounts \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 but still spent above the average purchase amount.\par
\tab\tab 3. Top 5 Products by Rating \endash  Found products with the highest average review \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 ratings.\par
\tab\tab 4. Shipping Type Comparison \endash  Compared average purchase amounts \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 between Standard and Express shipping.\par
\tab\tab 5. Subscribers vs. Non-Subscribers \endash  Compared average spend and total \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 revenue\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang9 across subscription status.\par
\tab\tab 6. Discount-Dependent Products \endash  Identified 5 products with the highest \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 percentage of\par
\tab\tab 7. Customer Segmentation \endash  Classified customers into New, Returning, and \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 Loya\f0\lang1033 l\f2\lang9  segments based on purchase history.\par
\tab\tab 8. Top 3 Products per Category \endash  Listed the most purchased products within \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 each\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang9 category.\par
\tab\tab 9. Repeat Buyers & Subscriptions \endash  Checked whether customers with >5 \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\tab\f2\lang9 purchases are\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang9 more likely to subscribe.\par
\tab\tab 10. Revenue by Age Group \endash  Calculated total revenue contribution of each age \f0\lang1033\tab\tab\f2\lang9 group.\par
\par
\b\fs28 5. Dashboard in Power BI\b0\fs22\par
\tab Finally, built an interactive dashboard in Power BI to present insights visually.\par

